<title>USA: Cellex Biolafitte unit opens U.S. plant.</title>
<headline>Cellex Biolafitte unit opens U.S. plant.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cellex Biosciences Inc said its LSL Biolafitte unit opened a U.S. plant in Allentown, Pa.</p>
<p>The plant will make stirred tank fermentation and cell culture systems, the company said.</p>
<p>Cellex and its French Biolafitte unit make cell processing systems used by biotechnology, drug and other customers.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
